tag: anime
desc: Japanese-style cartoons; means "manga" when combined with <a class="link-text" href="/+/tag/comics">#comics</a>.

tag: club
desc: Website clubs.

tag: code
desc: Contains computer code.

tag: collection
desc: Real-life piles of junk.

tag: comic
desc: Comics I drew.

tag: comics
desc: About comics other people drew.

tag: essay
desc: Long and/or self-serious and/or persuasive.

tag: fav
desc: My best stuff, according to me.

tag: fiction
desc: Fiction I wrote.

tag: fish
desc: The command shell, not the animal.

tag: hw
desc: Hardware.

tag: lit
desc: About literature other people wrote.

tag: meta
