desc: Palm Pilots and Palm OS.

tag: phil
desc: Philosophy.

tag: photo
desc: Photos I took.

tag: pixel-art
desc: Pixel art I made.

tag: poem
desc: Poems I wrote.

tag: recipe
desc: All <a class="link-text" href="/+/tag/vegan">vegan</a>.

tag: review
desc: Not necessarily actual reviews so much as collected notes and thoughts and reflection on my personal experience, but I try to reserve it for when I make some assessment of the quality.

tag: sf
desc: Science fiction.

tag: shrine
desc: Digital monuments to things I love.

tag: soop
desc: Infrequent meta posts about what's oop with the site.

tag: text-art
desc: Contains text art.

tag: tv
desc: Television.

tag: vegan
desc: This tag excludes most <a class="link-text" href="/+/tag/recipe">recipes</a> because they're all vegan anyway.

tag: visual-art
desc: <a class="link-text" href="/+/tag/comic">Comics</a>, <a class="link-text" href="/+/tag/photo">photos</a>, and <a class="link-text" href="/+/tag/pixel-art">pixel art</a> that I made.
